# OpenTofu provider cache — never committed (large binaries).
.terraform/
crash.log
*.tfstate.backup

# NOTE: terraform.tfstate IS committed for now — this is a private, single-operator repo (see README
# "State"). It contains no credentials (the provider token comes from the env), only the Cloudflare
# account id. Move to a remote backend (Cloudflare R2 / HCP) before the repo goes public or gains
# other operators.

# Real variable values — commit only the example (account_id also lives in the committed state).
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
